        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">We replaced a wine fridge we purchased some 6 years ago from a different manufacturer that &quot;died&quot; with a LeCavist wine fridge - we visited the showroom at Alexandria with one model in mind but upgraded to a dual zone model. We found the showroom staff knowlegeable but not &quot;pushy&quot; and would recommend anyone considering a wine fridge to attend the showroom before committing. We are very pleased with our buy: the fridge is attractive, easy to fill and extract bottles and the dual zone provides versatility. We look forward to many more years of wine storage.</p>
