          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— Andrew</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Jun 2024</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">I bought this a few months ago, despite a slight issue with delivery in the beginning, customer service was able to resolve quickly, and the cabinet delivered with no further issues. Suggest buying additional wooden shelf though as these are much nicer than the racks. Cabinet looks classy and dual zone temperature is perfect. Champagne and red wine collection is very comfortable now</p>
